Package: HAINETICU
Type: Package
Title: HAI-Net ICU Surveillance Annual Report Workflow
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
        person(given = "HAI-Net ICU surveillance analysis contributors",
                     email = "HAI-Net@ecdc.europa.eu",
                     role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Workflow for producing the annual ECDC HAI-Net ICU
    epidemiological report for healthcare-associated infections acquired in
    intensive care units in Europe. The repository cleans annual TESSy HAIICU
    exports, creates year-scoped analytical outputs, and renders R Markdown and
    Quarto report surfaces.
